  "abstract": "This submission reverts the model code to that of Evaluation ID 163 ('Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP with V-Orthogonality Reg'), removing the failed Factorized SSM Decoder implementation introduced in Evaluation ID 184. This serves as a regression test to re-establish the previous best-performing baseline before re-strategizing further SOTA integration with SSMs.",
